[b]RGO - Synthesis[/b]

A standalone agricultural RGO overhaul beginning with RGO Harmony's existing
compatibility map and required playset. The custom Synthesis mod is intended
to take Fruits Expanded's place in this playset; Fruits Expanded is not a
requirement.

[b]Required items[/b]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3809335454]More locations Mod[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3602513956]Global Historical RGOs[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3785316314]Just Goods[/url]
[/list]

Load the required mods in this order, with RGO - Synthesis last:
[list=1]
[*]Community Mod Framework
[*]More locations Mod
[*]Global Historical RGOs
[*]Just Goods
[*]RGO - Synthesis
[/list]

This initial scaffold retains RGO Harmony's current map compatibility behavior.
The proposed crop categories, fruit consolidations, and production-chain
changes are still under design and are not implemented yet.
